(SECURELIFE HEALTH ASSURANCE) Tj T*
(INDIVIDUAL HEALTH INSURANCE POLICY - SUMMARY OF BENEFITS) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(This document summarizes the terms of coverage under the SecureLife Basic Health Plan) Tj T*
(\("Policy"\) issued to the Policyholder named in the enrollment form.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. WAITING PERIOD. Coverage for any pre-existing condition, as defined in Section 12, shall) Tj T*
(not commence until forty-eight \(48\) months after the Policy Effective Date. Claims submitted) Tj T*
(for pre-existing conditions prior to this period will be denied in full.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2. PREMIUM ADJUSTMENT. SecureLife reserves the right to increase the annual premium at any) Tj T*
(time and at its sole discretion, with such changes taking effect thirty \(30\) days after) Tj T*
(notice is posted to the Policyholder's online account. Continued payment of premium after) Tj T*
(such notice constitutes acceptance of the revised rate.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3. CO-PAYMENT AND DEDUCTIBLE. The Policyholder is responsible for a co-payment of twenty) Tj T*
(percent \(20%\) of all inpatient hospitalization charges, in addition to an annual deductible) Tj T*
(of INR 50,000, which must be satisfied before any benefit becomes payable, per Policy Year.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4. ROOM RENT CAPPING. Reimbursement for hospital room rent is capped at one percent \(1%\) of) Tj T*
(the Sum Insured per day. Should the Policyholder occupy a room exceeding this limit, all) Tj T*
(associated charges - including doctor's fees, nursing charges, and consumables - shall be) Tj T*
(proportionately reduced, not solely the room rent difference.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(5. CLAIM DENIAL AND DISPUTE RESOLUTION. Any dispute regarding a denied or partially settled) Tj T*
(claim must be raised in writing within fifteen \(15\) days of the denial notice, and shall be) Tj T*
(resolved solely through binding arbitration conducted in the city where SecureLife's) Tj T*
(registered office is located. The Policyholder waives the right to pursue the claim through) Tj T*
(any civil court.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(6. POLICY CANCELLATION. SecureLife may cancel this Policy at any time by providing fifteen) Tj T*
(\(15\) days' written notice, without obligation to refund any portion of the premium already) Tj T*
(paid for the current Policy Year.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(7. RENEWAL. This Policy is renewable annually at SecureLife's sole discretion and is not) Tj T*
(guaranteed to be renewed regardless of the Policyholder's claims history.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(This summary is provided for convenience; the full Policy wording governs in the event of) Tj T*
(any conflict.) Tj T*
ET
